  data:
    Id: permafrost
    DisplayName: Permafrost
    Description: 'Frost does not bite the wearer back. Elemental family: Ice, the
      resistance half -- Frosty is Ice''s separate on-hit-frost affix and Frostbite
      carries the old bundle''s chill proc. Split off so each rule rolls on its own.'
